  "title": "Present Continuous",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "**Present Continuous** — то, что происходит сейчас: I **am reading**. Look, it **is raining**!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "Форма: **am / is / are + глагол с -ing**. Правила -ing: make → making (e выпадает), sit → sitting (согласная удваивается), lie → lying."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Лицо",
        "Present Continuous"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "I",
            "am working"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "he, she, it",
            "is working"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "you, we, they",
            "are working"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "Слова-подсказки: now, right now, at the moment, Look!, Listen!"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "es": "I'm waiting for the bus.",
      "ru": "Я жду автобус."
    },
    {
      "es": "It's raining again.",
      "ru": "Опять идёт дождь."
    },
    {
      "es": "Are you listening?",
      "ru": "Ты слушаешь?"
    },
    {
      "es": "They aren't working today.",
      "ru": "Сегодня они не работают."
    }
  ],
